

  claude-in-box
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

  A portable Claude Code dev environment.

  runtime    Node 20 · Python 3 + FastAPI · Go 1.25 · Rust
  services   nginx · redis · postgres · docker CLI
  tools      ripgrep · fd · bat · htop · tmux · vim · nano
  claude     `claude --version` to check; `claude` to start interactive

  Net egress is routed through transparent SOCKS5 when CIB_PROXY_URL is set.
  Workspace is mounted at /workspace ; box state at /var/lib/claude-in-box.

  Press <tab> twice on `claude<tab><tab>` to see every flag.

